    "Reason : 1 - Due to its excessive width and depth the proposed porch would constitute an overly dominant addition that would fail to relate subordinately to the main dwelling resulting in harm to the character and appearance of the local area and streetscene. The proposal would be unacceptable in design terms contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 as well as the guidance contained within the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD."
